OL,3,AMI5 chief warns of threats to UK from
OL,4,ARussia, Iran and AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FMI5 is devoting more resource to
OL,7,Fcountering state threats than during
OL,8,Fthe Cold War, the head of the
OL,9,Fintelligence service has said.
OL,11,FSir Ken McCallum said threats from
OL,12,Fforeign adversaries had quadrupled in
OL,13,Fthe last decade, with Russia "aggressor
OL,14,Fnumber one" as well as increased
OL,15,FIran-linked aggression against Jewish
OL,16,Fsites and military bases.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
