OL,3,AMan killed in tiger attack identified
OL,4,Aas William Chapman
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man who was killed by a tiger after
OL,7,Fentering its enclosure at a wildlife
OL,8,Fpark has been identified as William
OL,9,FChapman, the BBC understands.
OL,11,FChapman entered the enclosure at
OL,12,FYorkshire Wildlife Park near Doncaster
OL,13,Fshortly after 13:30 BST on Saturday and
OL,14,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene,
OL,15,Faccording to South Yorkshire Police.
OL,17,FAn eyewitness described seeing him
OL,18,Fwearing headphones and "pacing around"
OL,19,Fnear the enclosure before he went in
OL,20,Fand was attacked. Police confirmed he
OL,21,Fwas visiting the park on his own.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
