OL,3,AUK growth forecast upgraded but higher
OL,4,Aenergy prices to hit economy next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK economy is forecast to grow by
OL,7,Fmore than previously expected this year
OL,8,Fbefore higher energy prices and
OL,9,Finterest rates hit the economy in 2027,
OL,10,Fthe International Monetary Fund (IMF)
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe organisation's latest report, which
OL,14,Fis closely watched by the government,
OL,15,Fsaid the UK economy would expand by
OL,16,F1.3% in 2026, up from the 1% it
OL,17,Fpredicted in July, before slowing in
OL,18,F2027.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
