OL,3,AUS ambassador to Greece says post was
OL,4,Ahonour of a lifetime after Trump asks
OL,5,Aher to resign
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump has asked the US
OL,8,FAmbassador to Greece Kimberly Guilfoyle
OL,9,Fto resign following allegations of
OL,10,Fmisconduct
OL,12,FGuilfoyle allegedly asked a Trump donor
OL,13,Fto pay her hefty credit card bill in
OL,14,Fexchange for access to his
OL,15,Fadministration
OL,17,FTrump says "she was doing a good job,
OL,18,Fbut we didn't like what we were
OL,19,Freading"
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
