OL,3,AUS ambassador to Greece says post was
OL,4,Ahonour of a lifetime after Trump asks
OL,5,Aher to resign
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a statement, Guilfoyle - the former
OL,8,Ffiancee of Donald Trump Jr - denies the
OL,9,Fclaims against her and vows to
OL,10,F"vigorously defend my name"
OL,12,FReports Guilfoyle would leave the post
OL,13,Fwere confirmed by Trump's new White
OL,14,FHouse Press Secretary Katie Zacharia in
OL,15,Fher first briefing to journalists,
OL,16,Fwhere she took just three questions
OL,18,FAsked for his verdict, Trump calls her
OL,19,Fperformance "very good"
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
